# Production Environment Configuration
# This is used as default for npm run build
# 
# IMPORTANT DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. For local development: Create .env.development with VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# 2. For Vercel production: Set environment variable in Vercel dashboard:
#    - Go to Settings > Environment Variables
#    - Add: VITE_API_URL=https://web-production-ad6a36.up.railway.app
# 3. NEVER commit real URLs with localhost to production builds
#
# Backend API URL - Your deployed backend service
VITE_API_URL=https://web-production-ad6a36.up.railway.app
